#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:3
#: 5b9ce37c18c84b38b047dc3edf43db8c
msgid "层错路径（GSFE Path）"
msgstr "GSFE Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:5
#: 860602a4feaf47a88bc970abda86ff46
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:7
#: 4cdc502bf36545db9e1f9cd22fb86230
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:9
#: ba684e0e063b427d9d65b414d00152fe
msgid "在已经定向的输入晶胞中放置层间切面，并沿当前 `ab` 面内方向整体移动切面上方的原子，生成未弛豫的层错位移路径。卡片输出结构；路径能量需由后续 DFT 或势函数计算。"
msgstr ""
"Place an interlayer cut in an already oriented input cell and rigidly shift the atoms"
" above it along an in-plane direction of the current `ab` plane, generating an "
"unrelaxed generalized stacking-fault displacement path. The card outputs structures; "
"path energies must be computed afterward with DFT or an interatomic potential."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:11
#: 4c0296316ea54a76bac1faeb5c117a11
msgid "输入晶胞需要满足："
msgstr "The input cell must satisfy the following conditions:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:13
#: a730afb93a0047ada13db131a4f76eef
msgid "`a`、`b` 张成目标层错面；"
msgstr "`a` and `b` span the target fault plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:14
#: 74ccc81302a34e5fbea7f4ee2608a180
msgid "第三晶胞矢量 `c` 垂直于该面；"
msgstr "the third cell vector `c` is perpendicular to that plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:15
#: d9923089059e4200a6eb20f2ec1a6c86
msgid "原子沿面法向至少形成两个不同层。"
msgstr "atoms form at least two distinct layers along the plane normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:17
#: 4b0d895214da4bc993d7e38706b2936a
msgid ""
"原始体相中的 `(111)[11-2]` 不能直接照填。结构定向后，原始 `(111)` 面通常就是当前晶胞的 `(001)` 面，滑移方向也要换成当前 `a`、`b` "
"基矢下的系数。"
msgstr ""
"A bulk notation such as `(111)[11-2]` cannot be entered directly. After orientation, "
"the original `(111)` plane is usually the `(001)` plane of the current cell, and the "
"slip direction must also be converted to coefficients in the current `a`, `b` basis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:19
#: 5475c3626370404d95108153844bc351
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:21
#: b6c5a94d86964f26b2cc7a370a11a049
msgid "界面输入的面内方向 `[u v]` 定义滑移向量"
msgstr "The in-plane direction `[u v]` entered in the interface defines the slip vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:23
#: c2d2d075fcf74b118eedb57064565e89
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}=u\\mathbf a+v\\mathbf b.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:27
#: f6cbad187fd249fe8cbf5cb711134ade
msgid "“向量分数”模式下，路径值 $\\lambda$ 对应"
msgstr "In `Fraction of vector` mode, a path value $\\lambda$ corresponds to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:29
#: 1965cc89b2cc466284e368015ce1982d
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r=\\lambda\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}};\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:33
#: cf3e2be9b34d4b77a5263585e1f09d70
msgid "“Å 距离”模式下，路径值 $d$ 对应"
msgstr "In `Å distance` mode, a path value $d$ corresponds to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:35
#: 92d9c79331c44abdaecfe18d75ea96eb
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r=d\\frac{\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}}{|\\mathbf "
"b_{\\mathrm{slip}}|}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:39
#: c47338bcd2954a759b71e02083cd7681
msgid "程序根据所选切面得到移动集合，把其中每个原子加上同一位移，并为每个路径点生成一个结构。起点和终点均包含，step 必须为正。开启 wrap 时只沿周期方向把坐标折回晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"The program determines the moving set from the selected cut, adds the same "
"displacement to every atom in that set, and generates one structure per path point. "
"Both start and end are included, and the step must be positive. When wrapping is "
"enabled, coordinates are wrapped only along periodic directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:41
#: 4d9874fdd5cd464ca83ed6ddd5d84076
msgid "若后续用能量差计算单界面 GSFE，需要另行使用"
msgstr "To obtain a single-interface GSFE later from energy differences, apply separately"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:43
#: 1965cc89b2cc466284e368015ce1982d
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\gamma(\\lambda)=\\frac{E(\\lambda)-E(0)}{n_{\\mathrm{interface}}A},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:47
#: 38945b24861440dba2fff92857350ccb
msgid "其中 $A$ 是层错面面积，$n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ 是周期结构中的等价界面数。"
msgstr ""
"where $A$ is the fault-plane area and $n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ is the number of "
"equivalent interfaces in the periodic structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:49
#: 3f30c70d908e40d3ac9908faff548ee1
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:51
#: 2d4fb19c64e144bbab6123a72f90d039
msgid "fcc (111) 定向结构的完整周期路径"
msgstr "Complete Periodic Path for an Oriented fcc (111) Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:53
#: a2bd0d3f72354ead8c5330fe35ce345c
msgid "假设上游已经把 fcc 晶体定向为：当前 `a`、`b` 位于原始 `(111)` 面内，`c` 垂直该面。"
msgstr ""
"Assume an upstream operation has oriented the fcc crystal so that the current `a` and"
" `b` lie in the original `(111)` plane and `c` is perpendicular to it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:55
#: 627acf378104411182c2ce6d7237a752
msgid "面内方向设为 `[1,0]`。"
msgstr "Set the in-plane direction to `[1,0]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:56
#: 85fdef0242f84048abaf408bf90a216a
msgid "路径设为 `0 → 1，step 0.1`。"
msgstr "Set the path to `0 → 1` with a step of `0.1`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:57
#: 00e64a565854498fa4d40a5a3fa43e8d
msgid "单位选择“向量分数”。"
msgstr "Select `Fraction of vector` as the unit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:58
#: 2493a2756cf7457d864e051aa564ec8c
msgid "切面选择“中间”。"
msgstr "Select `Middle` as the cut position."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:60
#: 85c125fb7d9f471dbb4f8d20ebda00bd
msgid "若当前 `|a|=4 Å`，预览会显示 `0→1 向量 = 0→4 Å`，并生成 11 个结构。完整一个周期向量的终点可能与起点周期等价，这是闭合位移路径的正常结果。"
msgstr ""
"If the current `|a|=4 Å`, the preview shows `0→1 vector = 0→4 Å` and generates 11 "
"structures. The endpoint of one complete periodic vector may be periodically "
"equivalent to the starting point; this is normal for a closed displacement path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:62
#: 75b50bc094354528a96e74d2170eb302
msgid "若已知 Shockley partial 的实际位移长度，可把单位改成“Å 距离”，直接输入实际终点和步长。"
msgstr ""
"If the physical displacement length of a Shockley partial is known, switch the unit "
"to `Å distance` and enter the physical endpoint and step directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:64
#: 28062cec71e7411c854471c1814cdf3b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:66
#: e5168e3d18cf40ebb191585ba7bf316f
msgid "层错面（plane_hkl）"
msgstr "Fault Plane (plane_hkl)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:68
#: f21c29b8c23a4d73bc7eea84c47cb41c
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0,0,1)`。新界面把当前晶胞的 `ab` 面固定作为层错面，因此该字段自动保存为 `(001)`，不再要求用户重复填写。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default `(0,0,1)`. The current interface fixes the `ab` plane of the"
" current cell as the fault plane, so this field is saved automatically as `(001)` and"
" the user no longer has to enter it again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:70
#: 869cac620e834a97805c8e70d7361a80
msgid "旧工作流若保存了其他 `plane_hkl`，载入后会显示兼容提示并保持原值运行；编辑面内方向后切换到当前 `ab/(001)` 语义，不会静默改写载入时的结果。"
msgstr ""
"If an old workflow stores another `plane_hkl`, loading it displays a compatibility "
"notice and runs with the preserved value. Editing the in-plane direction switches to "
"the current `ab/(001)` semantics; the loaded result is not silently rewritten "
"beforehand."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:72
#: f4dd37bc899046689e254918919d541d
msgid "滑移方向（slip_uvw）"
msgstr "Slip Direction (slip_uvw)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:74
#: 90a06068f48a411d8ccb5fc6164eac79
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1,0,0)`。新界面只输入 `[u,v]`，并保存为 `(u,v,0)`，真实向量为 `u*a + v*b`。`[0,0]` "
"无法定义方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,0,0)`. The current interface accepts only `[u,v]` and "
"saves it as `(u,v,0)`; the physical vector is `u*a + v*b`. `[0,0]` does not define a "
"direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:76
#: dbb6744455e642d09c46188a02f6b661
msgid "旧配置中的非零 `w` 会在用户编辑方向前保持不变，并在界面显示兼容提示。"
msgstr ""
"A nonzero `w` from a legacy configuration is preserved until the user edits the "
"direction, and the interface displays a compatibility notice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:78
#: fa9a31c7e6c6417298dd49f70e615cd0
msgid "位移路径（displacement_range）"
msgstr "Displacement Path (displacement_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:80
#: 906f1c1aa6f84f59bd688d815361bdb5
msgid ""
"`Sequence[float]`，默认 `(0.0,1.0,0.1)`，格式为 `[start,end,step]`，因此默认生成 11 "
"个路径点。起点和终点包含在输出中；step 必须大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[float]`, default `(0.0,1.0,0.1)`, in `[start,end,step]` form, so the "
"default produces 11 path points. Both start and end are included in the output, and "
"the step must be greater than zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:82
#: 052a2c89074447c68e180f7fe6c45c68
msgid "位移单位（displacement_unit）"
msgstr "displacement_unit"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:84
#: e4450768f03d455dbce9740e7274dd69
msgid "`str`，默认 `fraction_of_vector`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `fraction_of_vector`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 3c2a285834404ac88e019ba422940e7e
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 1ec1f99eb26d4d64844bf14efa64c8bb
msgid "路径值的含义"
msgstr "Meaning of Path Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: e4450768f03d455dbce9740e7274dd69
msgid "`fraction_of_vector`"
msgstr "`fraction_of_vector`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 3ba028b694d149c99e543cfd59e6aa56
msgid "面内滑移向量的倍数"
msgstr "Multiple of the in-plane slip vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: a4134f571fb54e048fe1e68be7e12abd
msgid "`angstrom`"
msgstr "`angstrom`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 4029db858390432abbf8a96aeb5088a2
msgid "沿滑移方向的实际 Å 距离"
msgstr "Physical distance in Å along the slip direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:91
#: 19140f881d8044899df3428a17bb09bb
msgid "预览会把向量分数同时换算成实际 Å 距离。"
msgstr "The preview also converts a vector fraction to its physical distance in Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:93
#: 847dea73fd9c49b681d41a52d9e65fd0
msgid "切面位置（cut_mode）"
msgstr "cut_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:95
#: 2722debb6d0c45409b7ff124f13ae90b
msgid "`str`，默认 `middle`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `middle`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 547bd8a473e342e58527facad3221240
msgid "计算方式"
msgstr "How It Is Computed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: bcce84a3c6394d64836c35979bdb7bff
msgid "`middle`"
msgstr "`middle`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 977d998a181845fd952be22b3bad5632
msgid "在结构中部相邻两层之间放置切面"
msgstr "Place the cut between two adjacent layers near the middle of the structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 9455c0f4178a454e8e05cbe6709711b8
msgid "`fractional`"
msgstr "`fractional`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 697d4b4a0d014cd995ad671de5f2d46b
msgid "按最低到最高投影层之间的厚度比例放置"
msgstr ""
"Place the cut at a fraction of the thickness between the lowest and highest projected"
" layers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: a0ba2cfe9b1a4e0795bfce7144d17d37
msgid "`layer_index`"
msgstr "`layer_index`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: a8a123e244984852abaee9a275c131ad
msgid "在指定的下方层与下一层之间放置"
msgstr "Place the cut between the specified lower layer and the next layer"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:103
#: 69419256f4904fd4b00467921ff791e9
msgid "三种模式都要求切面两侧至少各有一个原子。"
msgstr "All three modes require at least one atom on each side of the cut."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:105
#: d07db32a09104754b8aea5b9beba273a
msgid "厚度分数（cut_fraction）"
msgstr "cut_fraction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:107
#: 07f21756dc2748dc9bccc06d94682c70
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.5`。仅在 `cut_mode=fractional` 时显示并生效；`0` 对应最低投影层，`1` "
"对应最高投影层。过于靠近边界而导致一侧没有原子时会报错。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.5`. Displayed and used only when `cut_mode=fractional`; `0` "
"corresponds to the lowest projected layer and `1` to the highest. An error is "
"reported if the cut lies so close to a boundary that one side contains no atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:109
#: a0ba2cfe9b1a4e0795bfce7144d17d37
msgid "下方层索引（layer_index）"
msgstr "Lower Layer Index (layer_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:111
#: 3c2ae7808f4d45f2b89aa2c606a42155
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。仅在 `cut_mode=layer_index` 时显示并生效。索引从 0 开始，切面位于该层和下一层之间，不能选择顶层。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Displayed and used only when `cut_mode=layer_index`. Indices "
"start at 0, and the cut is placed between the selected layer and the next one; the "
"top layer cannot be selected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:113
#: f8ee621f13c84b239e516d49f7252695
msgid "包回晶胞（wrap）"
msgstr "Wrap into Cell (wrap)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:115
#: 9306bf8a38c842dc9dee34977882f3cb
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启时沿周期方向把移动后的坐标折回晶胞；关闭时保留原始 Cartesian 位移，便于检查几何。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, shifted coordinates are wrapped into the cell "
"along periodic directions. When disabled, the original Cartesian displacement is "
"retained for geometry inspection."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:117
#: 898847f97aab46368cb0f3692e5d2fc6
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:119
#: 5d6d36b225ba4d0ca081775cca3d57f1
msgid "`Super Cell → GSFE Path`：先扩大面内周期，再生成层错路径。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell → GSFE Path`: enlarge the in-plane periodicity before generating the "
"fault path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:120
#: 2ba82ee930684370bc41ad4f7275e21f
msgid "`GSFE Path → Atomic Perturb`：在理想路径点附近补充小幅热扰动。"
msgstr ""
"`GSFE Path → Atomic Perturb`: add small thermal-like perturbations around ideal path "
"points."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:121
#: f5f5e84be7a14f93b72c611ad977e9ae
msgid "输出完成 DFT 单点后，比较能量曲线峰值、局部极小和路径对称性。"
msgstr ""
"After running DFT single-point calculations on the outputs, compare peaks, local "
"minima, and symmetry of the energy curve."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:123
#: 7493eabc6675413ab3d27261b71b019a
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:125
#: b9de33aa4a3a4123bd77283c5c787b13
msgid "**为什么结构提示未定向？** 当前第三晶胞矢量必须垂直于 `ab` 层错面。先在上游完成晶胞定向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the structure reported as unoriented?** The third vector of the current cell"
" must be perpendicular to the `ab` fault plane. Orient the cell upstream first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:127
#: 0b952e7256034a2c81b3d16900c049d4
msgid "**为什么移动的不是预期层？** 切换到“层索引”，预览会显示解析后的切面位置以及移动、保留的原子数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the wrong layers moving?** Switch to `Layer index`; the preview shows the "
"resolved cut position and the numbers of shifted and stationary atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:129
#: 74d0dd37f7164e6db53704bfc10aa426
msgid "**为什么向量分数 1.0 的终点看起来回到起点？** 完整晶格滑移向量在周期边界下可以与起点等价。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the endpoint at vector fraction 1.0 appear to return to the start?** A "
"complete lattice slip vector can be equivalent to the starting point under periodic "
"boundaries."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:131
