msgid "旧兼容几何会在标签中保留其原始 `hkl` 和 `uvw`。"
msgstr "A legacy-compatible geometry retains its original `hkl` and `uvw` in the label."

#~ msgid "严格 GSFE 路径（Strict GSFE Path）"
#~ msgstr "Strict GSFE Path"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按显式晶面 `hkl` 和滑移方向 `uvw` 生成未弛豫的广义层错能（GSFE）路径结构。输入必须已经是 "
#~ "slab-oriented cell：第三晶胞方向要垂直于 "
#~ "`plane_hkl`，否则周期边界会把断层面错接成重合或过近原子，程序会直接报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate unrelaxed generalized stacking-fault energy"
#~ " (GSFE) path structures from an explicit "
#~ "plane `hkl` and slip direction `uvw`. The "
#~ "input must already be slab oriented: its "
#~ "third cell direction must be normal to "
#~ "`plane_hkl`. Otherwise periodic boundaries can "
#~ "reconnect the fault into overlapping or "
#~ "excessively close atoms, and the card fails"
#~ " explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "相比 `Stacking Fault`，这张卡把滑移方向写成明确的晶向，并提供 "
#~ "`middle`、`fractional`、`layer_index` 三种切面选择。它适合你已经知道目标滑移系统，想要严格控制 GSFE"
#~ " 路径几何的场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unlike `Stacking Fault`, this card specifies a"
#~ " crystallographic slip direction and offers "
#~ "`middle`, `fractional`, and `layer_index` cut modes."
#~ " Use it when the target slip system "
#~ "is known and the GSFE geometry must be"
#~ " controlled explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 沿 slab cell 的 `(001)` 面和面内 "
#~ "`[100]` 周期方向生成 0 到 1 个滑移向量的路径，步长 0.1；这个 "
#~ "`(001)` 就是原始 fcc 的 `(111)` 面。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** In the slab cell, scan from "
#~ "0 to one slip vector in 0.1 increments"
#~ " along in-plane `[100]` on `(001)`. In "
#~ "this oriented basis, `(001)` corresponds to "
#~ "the original fcc `(111)` plane."

#~ msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。Miller 指数，定义哪一个晶面作为层错切面；该面的法向必须平行于第三晶胞方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(0,0,1)`. Miller indices "
#~ "of the fault plane. Its normal must be"
#~ " parallel to the third cell direction."

#~ msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1, 0, 0)`。晶向指数，定义滑移方向；程序会把它投影到 `plane_hkl` 所在平面内。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,0,0)`. Crystallographic "
#~ "direction projected into `plane_hkl` to define "
#~ "slip."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `slip_uvw` 平行于晶面法向，投影后长度为零，程序会报错。对于 fcc111 slab "
#~ "cell，先用 `[100]` 或另一个面内周期方向做完整周期路径；如果要扫特定 partial 位移，需要把"
#~ " slab cell 的面内基矢先构造成对应路径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If `slip_uvw` is parallel to the plane "
#~ "normal, its in-plane projection is zero "
#~ "and the card fails. For an fcc111 slab"
#~ " cell, begin with `[100]` or another "
#~ "periodic in-plane direction. A specific "
#~ "partial path requires constructing an in-plane"
#~ " basis that represents it."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`，`1.0` "
#~ "表示完整投影滑移向量；如果单位是 `angstrom`，数值就是 A。GSFE 曲线通常需要至少 0.05-0.1"
#~ " 的分辨率；只做 smoke 时可以用 0、0.5、1.0 三个点快速确认几何没错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `displacement_unit=\"fraction_of_vector\"`, `1.0` is "
#~ "the full projected slip vector. With "
#~ "`angstrom`, values are Å. A GSFE curve "
#~ "commonly needs 0.05-0.1 resolution; points 0, "
#~ "0.5, and 1.0 are sufficient only for a"
#~ " geometry smoke test."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `\"fraction_of_vector\"`。决定 `displacement_range` 里的数值怎么转成真实位移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `\"fraction_of_vector\"`. Converts "
#~ "`displacement_range` values to physical displacements."

#~ msgid "位移 = 数值乘以投影后的 `slip_uvw` 向量"
#~ msgstr "Displacement equals the value times the projected `slip_uvw` vector"

#~ msgid "扫完整 GSFE 周期或按晶向分数描述路径"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scan a complete GSFE period or express a"
#~ " path as fractions of a crystallographic "
#~ "vector"

#~ msgid "位移 = 数值 A，方向为投影滑移方向的单位向量"
#~ msgstr "Displacement is the value in Å along the normalized projected slip direction"

#~ msgid "按投影坐标中位数切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut at the median projected coordinate"

#~ msgid "普通超胞快速生成上下两半"
#~ msgstr "Quickly split a roughly uniform cell into two halves"

#~ msgid "按投影坐标范围的 `cut_fraction` 位置切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut at `cut_fraction` of the projected coordinate range"

#~ msgid "按排序后的离散层位置切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut between sorted discrete layers"

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 `0.5`。当 `cut_mode = \"fractional\"` 时使用，范围是 0 到 1。"
#~ msgstr "`float`, default `0.5`; used with `cut_mode=\"fractional\"`, range 0-1."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`cut_mode` 必须是 `fractional`。"
#~ msgstr "Active only when `cut_mode` is `fractional`."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。当 `cut_mode = \"layer_index\"` 时使用，选择哪一层下面保持不动、上面的层整体滑移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`; used with "
#~ "`cut_mode=\"layer_index\"`. Layers below the selected "
#~ "interface remain fixed and those above move."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`cut_mode` 必须是 `layer_index`。"
#~ msgstr "Active only when `cut_mode` is `layer_index`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "训练集导出通常建议打开，避免原子跑出可视化盒子导致后续工具误判。做几何调试或想直接看半晶体移动了多远时可以关闭；关闭后输出仍然是同一个周期 "
#~ "cell，但坐标可能超过原胞边界。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keep wrapping enabled for normal export so "
#~ "downstream tools see atoms inside the "
#~ "visualization cell. With it disabled, the "
#~ "periodic cell is unchanged but coordinates may"
#~ " lie outside its bounds."

#~ msgid "`Super Cell` → `Strict GSFE Path`：先扩胞，再切面滑移，降低小胞周期重复带来的假相互作用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Super Cell` -> `Strict GSFE Path`: enlarge"
#~ " before slip to reduce artificial periodic "
#~ "interactions."

#~ msgid "`Strict GSFE Path` → `Atomic Perturb`：在每个位移点附近加入小扰动，让模型不仅见过理想路径，也见过热扰动后的层错环境。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Strict GSFE Path` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add"
#~ " small finite-temperature geometry around each"
#~ " ideal displacement."

#~ msgid "`Bain Path` → `Strict GSFE Path`：先改变晶胞形状，再扫层错路径，用于相变或应变下的 GSFE 数据。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Bain Path` -> `Strict GSFE Path`: scan "
#~ "a fault path in a transformed or "
#~ "strained cell."

#~ msgid "**程序提示 slip_uvw 平行于 plane normal。** 这个方向投影到晶面内后长度为零，不能作为滑移方向。换一个面内晶向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`slip_uvw` is parallel to the plane "
#~ "normal.** Its in-plane projection is zero; "
#~ "choose an in-plane direction."

#~ msgid "**移动的原子层不是预期那一半。** 先切到 `layer_index` 模式，用离散层索引明确切面；普通 `middle` 适合均匀体相，不一定适合 slab。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The wrong layers move.** Use `layer_index` "
#~ "to select an explicit interface. `middle` "
#~ "suits a uniform bulk-like cell but may"
#~ " not suit a slab."

#~ msgid "**输出坐标超过晶胞边界。** 打开 `wrap`。如果你为了检查真实位移故意关闭了 `wrap`，这不是错误，但后续导出和可视化要知道坐标未包回。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Coordinates exceed cell bounds.** Enable `wrap`."
#~ " If it was intentionally disabled, treat "
#~ "output as unwrapped in later export and "
#~ "visualization."

#~ msgid "层错 / GSFE 路径（Stacking Fault / GSFE Path）"
#~ msgstr "Stacking Fault / GSFE Path"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按显式晶面 `hkl` 和滑移方向 `uvw` "
#~ "生成层错结构或未弛豫的广义层错（GSF）位移路径。卡片先在原子层之间放置切面，再把切面上方的原子作为一个整体沿面内方向移动；它只生成结构，不计算能量，也不做原子弛豫。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate stacking-fault structures or unrelaxed "
#~ "generalized stacking-fault (GSF) displacement paths"
#~ " from an explicit plane `hkl` and slip "
#~ "direction `uvw`. The card places a cut "
#~ "plane between atomic layers, then moves atoms"
#~ " above the plane as one group along "
#~ "an in-plane direction; it only generates "
#~ "structures and does not calculate energies or"
#~ " relax atoms."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "它不限定 fcc、(111) 面或某一种 Burgers 矢量，但输入必须已经按目标晶面定向：第三晶胞矢量要垂直于"
#~ " `层错面 (h k l)`（`plane_hkl`），否则程序会直接报错。`hkl` 和 "
#~ "`uvw` 都是相对于**当前晶胞基矢**的指数，不会自动识别或重定向原始体相晶胞里的 `(111)`、`[11-2]` "
#~ "等晶向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The card is not limited to fcc, the "
#~ "(111) plane, or one Burgers vector, but "
#~ "the input must already be oriented to "
#~ "the target plane: the third cell vector "
#~ "must be perpendicular to `Fault plane (h "
#~ "k l)` (`plane_hkl`), otherwise the program "
#~ "fails. Both `hkl` and `uvw` are indices "
#~ "in the **current cell basis**; the card "
#~ "does not automatically identify or reorient "
#~ "directions such as `(111)` or `[11-2]` in "
#~ "the original bulk cell."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "滑移方向必须本来就在层错面内；若含有面外分量，卡片会报错，不会静默投影成另一个方向。若只是为了补充训练集，可以直接使用输出结构；若要从能量差换算 "
#~ "GSFE，还必须自行确认周期边界中有一个还是两个层错界面，并使用正确的界面面积和界面数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The slip direction must lie in the fault"
#~ " plane. If it has an out-of-plane "
#~ "component, the card fails instead of silently"
#~ " projecting it to another direction. For "
#~ "training-set augmentation, the outputs can be "
#~ "used directly; to convert energy differences "
#~ "to GSFE, determine whether the periodic cell"
#~ " contains one or two fault interfaces and"
#~ " use the correct interface area and count."

#~ msgid "当前晶胞基矢为 $\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c$。用户给出的滑移指数定义"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Let the current cell basis be $\\mathbf "
#~ "a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c$. The user-provided "
#~ "slip indices define"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}=u\\mathbf a+v\\mathbf b+w\\mathbf c,\n"
#~ "\\qquad hu+kv+lw=0,\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "第二式是滑移方向位于 $(hkl)$ 面内的必要检查。对位移参数 $\\lambda$，分数向量模式使用 "
#~ "$\\Delta\\mathbf r=\\lambda\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}$；Å 模式使用"
#~ " \\(\\Delta\\mathbf r=d\\,\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}/ "
#~ "\\|\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}\\|\\)。切面上方原子统一加该位移，下方保持不动。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The second equation checks that the slip "
#~ "direction lies in the $(hkl)$ plane. For "
#~ "displacement parameter $\\lambda$, fractional-vector "
#~ "mode uses $\\Delta\\mathbf r=\\lambda\\mathbf "
#~ "b_{\\mathrm{slip}}$; Å mode uses $\\Delta\\mathbf "
#~ "r=d\\,\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}/\\|\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}\\|$."
#~ " Atoms above the cut receive this "
#~ "displacement together, while atoms below remain "
#~ "fixed."

#~ msgid "若用能量差计算广义层错能，应另行使用"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "To calculate generalized stacking-fault energy "
#~ "from energy differences, use separately"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\\gamma(\\lambda)=\n"
#~ "\\frac{E(\\lambda)-E(0)}{n_{\\mathrm{interface}}A},\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "场景：模型在指定滑移系的 GSFE 峰值严重偏低"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The GSFE peak is too low for a specified slip system"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 fcc Ni 上训练了 NEP，体相和弹性响应都不错，但 (111)<112> 的"
#~ " GSFE 峰值比 DFT "
#~ "低很多。训练集里虽然有随机扰动和表面，但没有沿这个滑移系系统移动半晶体的结构，模型没学到层间错排的能量代价。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An fcc Ni NEP has good bulk and "
#~ "elastic response but strongly underestimates the "
#~ "(111)<112> GSFE peak. Random perturbations and "
#~ "surfaces do not replace systematic half-"
#~ "crystal displacement along that slip system."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 fcc111 slab-oriented 周期超胞，例如 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 的 `fcc111` 原型。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A periodic fcc111 slab-oriented "
#~ "cell, such as the `fcc111` prototype from "
#~ "`Crystal Prototype Builder`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 沿当前 slab cell 的 `(001)` 面和面内 "
#~ "`[100]` 周期方向生成 0 到 1 个滑移向量的路径，步长 "
#~ "0.1；在这个特定定向晶胞里，`(001)` 对应原始 fcc 的 `(111)` 面。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** generate a path from 0 to 1"
#~ " full slip vector along the `(001)` plane"
#~ " and in-plane `[100]` periodic direction of"
#~ " the current slab cell, with a step "
#~ "of 0.1. In this particular oriented cell, "
#~ "`(001)` corresponds to the original fcc "
#~ "`(111)` plane."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`层错面 (h k l)`填 `[0, 0, 1]`；"
#~ msgstr "Set `Fault plane (h k l)` to `[0, 0, 1]`;"

#~ msgid "`滑移方向 [u v w]`填 `[1, 0, 0]`；"
#~ msgstr "Set `Slip direction [u v w]` to `[1, 0, 0]`;"

#~ msgid "`位移范围`填 `[0.0, 1.0, 0.1]`；"
#~ msgstr "Set `Displacement range` to `[0.0, 1.0, 0.1]`;"

#~ msgid "**输出：** 11 个未弛豫层错结构，带 `GSFE(hkl=001,uvw=100,d=...)` 标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Eleven unrelaxed fault structures "
#~ "labeled `GSFE(hkl=001,uvw=100,d=...)`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 对输出结构做 DFT 单点或短弛豫后加入训练集，重训再扫同一 GSFE "
#~ "路径。峰值、局部极小位置和曲线对称性应更接近 DFT；如果只有峰值改善但曲线仍有锯齿，把步长从 0.1 缩到 "
#~ "0.05。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**How to verify the improvement:** Obtain DFT"
#~ " single points or consistently defined short "
#~ "relaxations, retrain, and rescan the same "
#~ "path. Compare peak height, local minima, and"
#~ " curve symmetry with DFT. If the peak "
#~ "improves but the curve remains jagged, refine"
#~ " the displacement step from 0.1 to 0.05."

#~ msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。当前晶胞基矢下的 Miller 指数，定义层错面的法向；该法向必须平行于第三晶胞矢量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(0, 0, 1)`. Miller "
#~ "indices in the current cell basis defining "
#~ "the fault-plane normal; this normal must "
#~ "be parallel to the third cell vector."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "低指数面最常用：fcc111 slab cell 里用 `(001)` 表示原始 fcc"
#~ " `(111)` 面。`(0, 0, 0)` 没有物理意义，程序会直接报错。普通 cubic"
#~ " fcc cell 里的 `(111)` 不满足 slab-oriented "
#~ "要求，不能直接使用。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Low-index planes are typical. In an "
#~ "fcc111-oriented slab cell, `(001)` denotes the "
#~ "original fcc `(111)` plane. `(0,0,0)` is "
#~ "invalid. A conventional cubic fcc cell with"
#~ " `(111)` does not satisfy the required slab"
#~ " orientation without reorientation."

#~ msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1, 0, 0)`。当前晶胞基矢下的方向指数，真实滑移向量为 `u*a + v*b + w*c`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(1, 0, 0)`. Direction "
#~ "indices in the current cell basis; the "
#~ "physical slip vector is `u*a + v*b + "
#~ "w*c`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "方向必须位于 `层错面 (h k l)`（`plane_hkl`）面内；在晶格指数下等价于 `h*u"
#~ " + k*v + l*w = 0`。不满足时程序会报错，避免用户填写 `[u "
#~ "v w]`，实际却得到另一个投影方向。对于 fcc111 slab cell，可以用 "
#~ "`[100]`、`[010]` 或另一个面内方向；如果要扫特定 partial 位移，需要让当前晶胞的面内基矢或 Å"
#~ " 位移范围对应目标 Burgers 矢量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The direction must lie in `Fault plane "
#~ "(h k l)` (`plane_hkl`), equivalent to `h*u "
#~ "+ k*v + l*w = 0` in lattice "
#~ "indices. The program fails otherwise, preventing "
#~ "a user-entered `[u v w]` from silently"
#~ " becoming a different projected direction. For"
#~ " an fcc111 slab cell, use `[100]`, `[010]`,"
#~ " or another in-plane direction; to scan "
#~ "a specific partial displacement, make the "
#~ "in-plane basis or Å range correspond to "
#~ "the target Burgers vector."

#~ msgid "`Sequence[float]`，默认 `(0.0, 1.0, 0.5)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, 步长]`，扫描滑移位移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[float]`, default `(0.0,1.0,0.5)`. Slip "
#~ "displacement scan as `[start,stop,step]`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`，`1.0` 表示完整"
